(module OLED_HS13L03W2C01_1.3in_FrontPanel (layer F.Cu) (tedit 68EB0000)
  (descr "Front-panel footprint for the HS (Shenzhen Hansheng) HS13L03W2C01 1.3in 128x64 I2C OLED module (LCSC C7465997): 4 mounting holes plus the viewing window. NOTHING for the module itself belongs on the mid board. AUTHORED 2026-10-12 from studio/press/references/components/screens/lcsc-oled-modules/hs-HS13L03W2C01-datasheet.pdf section 1.4 mechanical drawing (hs-HS13L03W2C01-mechanical-drawing-upright.png), drawing #A1 2016/09/10, X +/-0.2. ORIGIN is the ACTIVE-AREA CENTRE. Viewed from the front, module upright as in the drawing (pin header edge toward -y). SOURCED: 4 holes at pitch 30.40 x 28.50 (x +/-15.20; y -12.20 and +16.30): module PCB 35.40 x 33.50, upper holes 2.50 from the top edge, active area 29.42 x 14.70 centred left-right and its centre 14.70 from the top, i.e. 2.05 above the hole-pattern centre; module hole dia 3.00 (pad ring 4.50), here NPTH dia 3.0 M3 clearance as briefed; viewing aperture 31.42 x 16.70 (drawing dims 31.42, 16.70, 6.35) bounds the window. UNSOURCED: window = active area + 0.50 per side = 30.42 x 15.70 (inside the 31.42 x 16.70 aperture), corner radius 0.5 (JLC rounded-corner rule, references/fab/jlcpcb-capabilities/; radius inference as for the LED), courtyard; the module's panel-to-glass standoff and the front/back face of the module are not in this footprint.")
  (tags "OLED HS13L03W2C01 SH1106 1.3in front panel cutout C7465997")
